  "atomic_cutover": "Both packages modules/identityaccess/legacy/usercontext and modules/identityaccess/inbound/usercontext are deleted in one PR together with every import of them. The identity chain, the caller's groups, navigation, SSE subscription, profile self-edits, the parent request review policy and student access move into the Identity & Access application behind identityaccess.CallerContext and run over its own ports. services/caller_context.go binds those ports to People Directory, School Membership (#3498), School Structure (#3499), Student Presence (#3500) and the retained activity repository. Each consumer declares its own port, served by database/repositories.CallerRows. /api/me moves to modules/identityaccess/inbound/me with unchanged paths, status codes, error texts and JSON shapes. The #2099 request memo moves with the application; its per-request slot stays in the session adapter, so RequestIdentityCacheMiddleware stays mounted exactly as before.",
